The node's `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`, so I left out the enrichment fetch. Calling `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich` would need an HTTP import the node wasn't granted. It would also send the tick's text to an outside service. If the node needs that enrichment, add an `HTTPClient` capability (with that host allowlisted) to its `with` clause in the graph, and I can add the call then.

